      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009#sch-1-sec-275d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "275D Emergency law",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Part:\nemergency law means a law specified under subsection (2).\n\n(2) The Minister administering the Administrative Decisions (Judicial\nReview) Act 1977 may, by legislative instrument, specify a law of a\nState or a Territory for the purposes of the definition of emergency\nlaw in subsection (1) of this section."
    },
