    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-295w",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "295W Use or disclosure of information by other persons",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009#sch-1-sec-295w"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Actual or likely emergencies\n\n(1) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(1) or (2) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose\nthe information for a purpose connected with persons being alerted\nto the emergency or likely emergency concerned.\nTesting\n\n(2) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(3) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose the\ninformation for the purpose of reasonable testing of whether, in the\nevent of an emergency occurring, persons would be able to be\nalerted to that emergency.\nOther\n\n(3) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(4) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose the\ninformation for a purpose connected with persons being alerted to\nan emergency or a likely emergency.",
      "skos:definition": "Actual or likely emergencies\n\n(1) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(1) or (2) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose\nthe information for a purpose connected with persons being alerted\nto the emergency or likely emergency concerned.\nTesting\n\n(2) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(3) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose the\ninformation for the purpose of reasonable testing of whether, in the\nevent of an emergency occurring, persons would be able to be\nalerted to that emergency.\nOther\n\n(3) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(4) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose the\ninformation for a purpose connected with persons being alerted to\nan emergency or a likely emergency.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-295w-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-295w-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-295w-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7d37caee57411a7819e0dc4dc44f8c315ee9c188191e92725307a47c00713aba"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009#sch-1-sec-295w",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "295W Use or disclosure of information by other persons",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Actual or likely emergencies\n\n(1) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(1) or (2) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose\nthe information for a purpose connected with persons being alerted\nto the emergency or likely emergency concerned.\nTesting\n\n(2) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(3) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose the\ninformation for the purpose of reasonable testing of whether, in the\nevent of an emergency occurring, persons would be able to be\nalerted to that emergency.\nOther\n\n(3) If information is disclosed to a person as permitted by subsection\n295V(4) or this subsection, the person may use or disclose the\ninformation for a purpose connected with persons being alerted to\nan emergency or a likely emergency."
    },
