    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-291a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "291A Location dependent carriage services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009#sch-1-sec-291a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of\ninformation or a document if:\n\n(a) the information or document relates to information (other\nthan information relating to an unlisted telephone number)\ncontained in an integrated public number database; and\n\n(b) the disclosure is to a carrier or a carriage service provider;\nand\n\n(c) the disclosure is made for a purpose of, or is connected with,\nthe supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a location\ndependent carriage service.\n\n(2) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure or use by a\ncarrier or a carriage service provider of information or a document\nif:\n\n(a) the information or document relates to information (other\nthan information relating to an unlisted telephone number)\ncontained in an integrated public number database; and\n\n(b) the disclosure or use is made for a purpose of, or is connected\nwith, the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a\nlocation dependent carriage service.\n\n(3) In this section:\nintegrated public number database means:\n\n(a) an integrated public number database maintained by Telstra\nas mentioned in Part 4 of Schedule 2; or\n\n(b) an integrated public number database maintained by a person\nas mentioned in section 472.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nLocation dependent carriage services  Part 2",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of\ninformation or a document if:\n\n(a) the information or document relates to information (other\nthan information relating to an unlisted telephone number)\ncontained in an integrated public number database; and\n\n(b) the disclosure is to a carrier or a carriage service provider;\nand\n\n(c) the disclosure is made for a purpose of, or is connected with,\nthe supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a location\ndependent carriage service.\n\n(2) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure or use by a\ncarrier or a carriage service provider of information or a document\nif:\n\n(a) the information or document relates to information (other\nthan information relating to an unlisted telephone number)\ncontained in an integrated public number database; and\n\n(b) the disclosure or use is made for a purpose of, or is connected\nwith, the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a\nlocation dependent carriage service.\n\n(3) In this section:\nintegrated public number database means:\n\n(a) an integrated public number database maintained by Telstra\nas mentioned in Part 4 of Schedule 2; or\n\n(b) an integrated public number database maintained by a person\nas mentioned in section 472.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nLocation dependent carriage services  Part 2",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-291a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-291a-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-291a-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9179cfaf6f8fede1c84dfe4f94b257490abc3c92da24fc256080a6c14b896aa3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009#sch-1-sec-291a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "291A Location dependent carriage services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure by a person of\ninformation or a document if:\n\n(a) the information or document relates to information (other\nthan information relating to an unlisted telephone number)\ncontained in an integrated public number database; and\n\n(b) the disclosure is to a carrier or a carriage service provider;\nand\n\n(c) the disclosure is made for a purpose of, or is connected with,\nthe supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a location\ndependent carriage service.\n\n(2) Sections 276 and 277 do not prohibit a disclosure or use by a\ncarrier or a carriage service provider of information or a document\nif:\n\n(a) the information or document relates to information (other\nthan information relating to an unlisted telephone number)\ncontained in an integrated public number database; and\n\n(b) the disclosure or use is made for a purpose of, or is connected\nwith, the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a\nlocation dependent carriage service.\n\n(3) In this section:\nintegrated public number database means:\n\n(a) an integrated public number database maintained by Telstra\nas mentioned in Part 4 of Schedule 2; or\n\n(b) an integrated public number database maintained by a person\nas mentioned in section 472.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nLocation dependent carriage services  Part 2"
    },
