    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-302a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "302A Location dependent carriage services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009#sch-1-sec-302a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If information or a document is disclosed to a person as permitted\nby section 291A or this subsection, a person must not disclose or\nuse the information or document except for the purpose of, or in\nconnection with, the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a\nlocation dependent carriage service.\nNote:\nSection 291A deals with the disclosure or use of information or\ndocuments for the purposes of the supply, or proposed supply, by a\nperson of a location dependent carriage service.\n\n(2) In this section:\nlocation dependent carriage service means a carriage service that\ndepends for its provision on the availability of information about\nthe addresses of end users of the carriage service.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If information or a document is disclosed to a person as permitted\nby section 291A or this subsection, a person must not disclose or\nuse the information or document except for the purpose of, or in\nconnection with, the supply, or proposed supply, by a person of a\nlocation dependent carriage service.\nNote:\nSection 291A deals with the disclosure or use of information or\ndocuments for the purposes of the supply, or proposed supply, by a\nperson of a location dependent carriage service.\n\n(2) In this section:\nlocation dependent carriage service means a carriage service that\ndepends for its provision on the availability of information about\nthe addresses of end users of the carriage service.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-302a-ss-1"
        },
